  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ( C1052-PL-A-001 Rev: A; C1052-PL-A-02; C1052-PL-A-03; C1052-PL-A-04; C1052-SK-A-004 Rev: A; C1052-SK-A-007 Rev: A; cur/2565/DandA; Unnumbered Transport Assessment; AQ_assessment/2019/Feltham_data_centre V2; PWH/jas/1426R/4688 Noise Report. Received: 26/04/2019.\r\nC1052-PL-A-01 Rev: A; C1052-PL-A-05 Rev: A. Received: 10/07/2019. ) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - a)\tThe cumulative measured or calculated noise emitted from the plant hereby approved shall be 10dB(A) below the existing background noise level, at all times whilst the plant is in operation.\r\nb)\tThe plant shall be isolated on adequate proprietary anti-vibration mounts to prevent the structural transmission of vibration and regenerated noise within adjacent or adjoining premises, and these shall be so maintained thereafter unless agreed otherwise in writing by the Local Planning Authority.\r\nc)\tFollowing installation of any mechanical services plant including heating, ventilation and air conditioning (HVAC) to which the application refers, a post completion noise assessment shall be submitted for approval to the local planning authority which demonstrates the actual measured rating level of plant operating under normal conditions. All measurements shall be made in accordance with the methodology of BS4142: 2014 (Methods for rating and assessing industrial and commercial sound) and/or its subsequent amendments. \r\nThe post completion report shall be both completed and submitted to the local authority within 28 days of completion of the installation for review\r\n"
  ],
